        <mxCell id="UDif3aBzBAIm1otjnsbJ-41" value="O colaborador recebe os valores diretamente na conta bancária.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;O colaborador vai receber algumas variáveis específicas para isso, e essas variáveis foram retiradas da documentação do Pagar.me.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;+ recipiendid: String =&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;76&quot; data-start=&quot;59&quot;&gt;&lt;code data-end=&quot;74&quot; data-start=&quot;61&quot;&gt;recipientId&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; → é o &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot; data-end=&quot;113&quot; data-start=&quot;83&quot;&gt;identificador do recebedor&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt; (quem vai receber o dinheiro)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1">
